statement:
Find the number of polynomials $f(x) = a x^3 + b x$ that satisfy the following conditions:
(1) $a, b \in \{1, 2, \dots, 2013\}$;
(2) the difference of any two numbers among $f(1)$, $f(2)$, $\dots$, $f(2013)$ is not a multiple of $2013$.

Suppose $f(x+2\pi) = f(x)$ for any $x \in \mathbb{R}$. Prove: there are $f_i(x)$ ($i = 1, 2, 3, 4$) such that

(1) $f_i(x)$ ($i = 1, 2, 3, 4$) is an even function, and $f_i(x + \pi) = f_i(x)$ for any $x \in \mathbb{R}$;

(2) $f(x) = f_1(x) + f_2(x)\cos x + f_3(x)\sin x + f_4(x)\sin 2x$ for any $x \in \mathbb{R}$.
